    persistence via a fresh connection) PASS in Chrome via
    `flutter drive ... -d web-server --browser-name=chrome` (test_driver/ added,
    chromedriver 151 required). Notes in web/DRIFT_WEB.md.
    Caveats (not blockers): OPFS needs COOP/COEP hosting headers, else drift
    falls back to IndexedDB (still persistent). Local notifications don't exist
